  "prefLabel": "Soil 301.01 Application Process",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Soil 301.01 Application Process.\n\n(a) The initial application to become an apprentice soil or wetland scientist or certified as a soil or wetland scientist shall be processed in accordance with Plc 304.06 through Plc 304.10.\n\n(b) A person wishing to become an apprentice soil or wetland scientist shall submit the following:\n\n(1) The “Universal Application for Initial Licensure” and the “Soil or Wetland Scientist Apprentice Addendum to the Universal Application for Initial Licensure” required by Soil 301.02(a);\n\n(2) If the applicant answered in the affirmative to any of the yes or no questions on the “Universal Application for Initial Licensure” form, a detailed description of the incident(s);\n\n(3) A completed “Professional Reference Form” described in Soil 301.04(b);\n\n(4) A certified copy of transcripts from all post-secondary institutions attended, as described in Soil 301.02(b)(2); and\n\n(5) The application fee specified in Plc 1002.31.\n\n(c) A person wishing to become certified as a soil or wetland scientist shall submit the following:\n\n(1) A completed “Universal Application for Initial Licensure” and a “Soil or Wetland Scientist Addendum to the Universal Application for Initial Licensure” required by Soil 301.02(c);\n\n(2) A certified copy of transcripts from all post-secondary institutions attended, as described in Soil 301.02(b)(2);\n\n(3) A completed “Professional Reference Form” described in Soil 301.04(b);\n\n(4) Copies of at least 6 maps as follows:\n\na. For wetland scientists, the maps described in Soil 302.04(b); and\n\nb. For soil scientists, the maps as described in Soil 302.02(c);\n\n(5) A passing score on the examination described in Soil 303;\n\n(6) If the applicant answered in the affirmative to any of the yes or no questions located on the “Universal Application for Initial Licensure” described in Plc 304.03(e), a detailed description of the incident(s); and\n\n(7) The application fee specified in Plc 1002.31.\n\nSource. #4676, eff 9-20-89, EXPIRED: 9-20-95\n\nNew. #6232, eff 4-26-96; ss by #6881, eff 11-13-98; ss by #8621, eff 5-2-06; ss by #9886-A, eff 3-11-11, EXPIRED: 3-11-19\n\nNew. #14019, eff 9-6-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Soil 300); ss by #14455, eff 2-8-26, EXPIRES: 2-8-36",
